<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Fixture with invented data in the structure of a DFS AIXM 5.1.1 aerodrome dataset (ED_AirportHeliport). Includes an international airport, a small airfield without an ICAO
  location indicator style designator, and a heliport, so the importer's identifier handling
  is exercised.

  Every identifier, name, frequency and position here is invented. Only the structure
  follows the published format, so the importers can be tested without reproducing any
  part of a DFS dataset.
-->
